WEBVTT

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:08.440
I...

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.490
I want to see you one more time.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:17.530
I want to grant you your wish.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.330
But that wish no longer...

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:23.330
Sir...

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:30.590
It would be okay if you came out
to laugh at me and say, "You fledgling!"

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:32.720
But I know...

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:38.350
You'd tell me to awkwardly struggle
until the very end, right?

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:40.310
I'll do it...

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.810
because I am one of your loyal subjects.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:49.400
Is that you, Reines?

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:51.400
Yeah, we have no choice.

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:54.110
I will bow my head down
to Sir Sophia-Ri myself.

00:00:56.410 --> 00:01:00.030
I need to resolve a complicated situation
over at Spiritual Evocation, right?

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:44.010
My, oh my.

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:45.850
This is perfect.

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:47.730
I want to ask you something.

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:51.100
Oh no, it won't take
too much of your time.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:59.030
Why can't you, sir?

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:00.820
I'm not good enough?

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:04.240
I'm sorry. I do find you to be very charming.

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:05.870
Are you in love with someone?

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:07.730
Yeah.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:10.160
Well, I guess you could say that.

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:15.290
Isn't it about time,
Primary Lecturer Wills?

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.010
Sorry to show you such a big mess.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.670
You still are popular
with the girls as always.

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:23.720
Good thinking though
to leave the door open

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.640
when you'll be alone
with a female student.

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:28.770
Sorry to trouble you, Lord.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:30.520
No, pardon me.

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:34.610
Is this the first time we speak like this
since your father's funeral?

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:36.900
I finally got all personal affairs in order.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:41.900
Sir Trevor Pelham Codrington
was a grand Necromancer.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:45.030
Once again, I give you my condolences.

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:50.500
So, what did you want to ask of me
as one of the authorities in Spiritual Evocation?

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:53.750
Five years ago,
my father purchased wasteland,

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.000
including a whole ancient
Roman monument.

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.250
The Marburry Workshop.

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:01.010
Transforming an entire wasteland
into a Workshop,

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:04.220
the strength of its magical energy
rivals that of a shrine.

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:09.520
However, the Marburry Workshop
ran out of control.

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:14.600
With a series of lightning falling,
not only did all the family Mages perish,

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:18.520
but more than a dozen
local civilian lives were lost.

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:22.700
And the last casualty was my father.

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:27.830
It was caused
by a Leyline becoming warped.

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:30.160
You already know that far?

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:32.450
For Magical Workshops of that style,

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:35.080
it's hard to think of other sources
of magical energy.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:40.250
But it's strange that someone
as prolific as Sir Trevor couldn't repair it.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:43.050
If accidents at the Workshop continue,

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:45.680
there's nothing I can do anymore.

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:47.850
In other words, Elder Brother,

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:49.310
if this continues,

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:54.270
the Marburry Workshop will be taken up
by the main Codrington Family, land and all.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:57.610
I see. But if a Workshop
of that caliber is confiscated,

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:01.610
it would hurt Bram, as well, huh?

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:05.910
I also have one more thing
I needed to consult you on.

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:09.490
I'll talk about that on-site.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:11.490
Understood.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:14.960
I will take care of this case.

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:39.360
I'm grateful you egged him on,
Princess of El-Melloi.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:41.020
But of course.

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:44.070
If it's for the next department head
of Spiritual Evocation,

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:47.990
my elder brother vows to even pull
chestnuts out of the fire as needed.

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.240
What beautiful sibling love you have.

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:57.460
But is he still obsessed with that ritual?
Holy Grail War, was it?

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:58.620
Yes.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:02.290
The Clock Tower is sending Atrum Galliasta

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:04.760
and Bazett Fraga McRemitz.

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:07.880
But there still is a slot left.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:10.510
At least, that's what
my elder brother believes.

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:16.680
If I were to mediate, I could probably
shove him into the McRemitz slot.

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:22.360
But to think someone
who is at least temporarily a Lord

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:26.690
to bow down to me
for a shady ritual like that...

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:31.030
Come now. The previous Lord El-Melloi
and your little sister

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:34.200
both died in a shady
Holy Grail War, didn't they?

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:37.120
Are you saying I should mourn?

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:38.910
Surely not.

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:50.630
They say you shrivel up
without any curiosity.

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:57.310
Damn that lass.

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:11.570
So, can you finally
talk to me about this?

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:15.780
This is essentially
within Spiritual Evocation's jurisdiction.

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:17.700
So, why me?

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:19.330
That's because...

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:25.710
The main Codrington Family filed a complaint
about this to the Policies Department.

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:28.420
To Policies?

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:31.680
They said that the Workshop
is unstable because of me,

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:34.680
and at this rate, it will breach
Concealment of the Mystics,

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:36.680
so the main family needs to manage it.

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:41.440
And that would be troublesome
for that guy Bram.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:45.980
But Spiritual Evocation
openly meddling in an inheritance dispute

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.360
would give them a bad rep.

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:53.610
All right. I was the one
set to doing Sir Sophia-Ri a favor.

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.790
<i>I'll do anything it takes...</i>

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:02.580
<i>if it means I can participate
in a Holy Grail War once again!</i>

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.430
Ms. Reines?

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:24.140
Here, take this.

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:26.860
Are you okay?

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:29.480
Yeah, I have to endure it
for a little while.

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:31.440
It's nothing much.

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:37.070
It seems the Leyline balance
is less stable than I thought.

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:38.580
She has Mystic Eyes?

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:43.460
Yes. When Reines comes in contact
with magical energy, her eyes turn red.

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:46.330
But it's not often that pain accompanies it.

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:54.470
It feels like back when I was younger
when I stuck my hand into the fireplace.

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:57.600
Though, I'll be okay
as long as I use some eye drops.

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:00.560
It might be better for us to hurry.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:02.520
Sir?

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:06.520
The wind elements are moving furiously.

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:10.020
A storm is coming.

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:13.030
Lord El-Melloi II's Case Files
｛Rail Zeppelin｝ Grace note

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:27.290
Are you all right, Lord?

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:32.550
I-I didn't think we'd be walking
such a long distance.

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:35.800
You're still a frail little boy.

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:37.760
Indeed, a little boy.

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:39.850
Who is a little boy?

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:45.140
You have finally returned.

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:54.110
Hold it.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:57.360
I didn't think
you'd already be over here.

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:00.370
Ms. Adashino.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:04.750
It's been a while, Lord El-Melloi II.

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.380
As long as a complaint has been filed,

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:14.630
it is the duty of Policies
to promptly carry out an investigation.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:17.880
And as a result of that investigation...

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:19.050
It can't be!

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:21.100
Yes.

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:26.520
Wills Pelham Codrington is under arrest
as a suspect in the murder of Sir Trevor.

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:31.900
H-Hold on just a minute!
How did things end up that way?

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:33.190
Oh?

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.190
Shut up, you father-killer!

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:38.280
W-Waletta!

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:41.070
Ms. Adashino, who is she?

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:43.240
She is Waletta Codrington,

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:48.370
sent from the main Codrington Family
of Necromancy to ascertain the situation.

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:49.790
Upon arrival,

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:54.250
I immediately tried calling down
Sir Trevor to learn his circumstances.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:57.050
But all traces of him were gone!

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.630
I see. That's quite the tale.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.720
Sir, what does that mean?

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.390
Calling someone down with Necromancy

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:07.220
is summoning the residual
thoughts of the dead.

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:11.730
However, not all who have died
can be called down.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.860
The residual thoughts can wear down,
or the communication can be disturbed.

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:18.610
Erasing all traces of him
is a serious matter.

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:22.160
Right. To erase all traces
of residual thoughts

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:27.330
is similar to someone wiping away
fingerprints in a criminal investigation.

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:28.370
That's right!

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:30.750
And it can only be done...

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.710
by a Necromancer!

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:35.960
Stop. That is only circumstantial evidence.

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:38.800
You are ignoring the possibility
of other perpetrators.

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:40.840
We're not talking just Sir Trevor!

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:44.800
I failed to call down everyone involved
in these accidents involving lightning!

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:48.220
And every time lightning has fallen,
Wills was present within the mansion!

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:51.560
It's a misunderstanding, Waletta!

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:55.060
It's true that I tried to call down
the soul of my father.

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:56.770
But I failed!

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:00.280
And can you prove that?

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:01.530
Well, that...

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:05.530
I believe all of this evidence
will be enough.

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:07.200
Wait just a minute.

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:11.910
Oh? Are you saying a great detective
is entering the scene again?

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:14.120
Just look outside.

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:16.710
In this storm,
it's dangerous to drive a car.

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:18.880
And all this lightning...

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:23.090
Surely you haven't forgotten
how Sir Trevor passed away.

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:28.760
You mean, at the least,
we're riveted here until this storm passes.

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:30.020
That's right.

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:31.640
Therefore, Ms. Adashino,

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:36.520
I would like permission to investigate
this Workshop until the storm passes.

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:37.610
That's nonsense!

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:40.730
Modern Magecraft Theories dares
trample upon Spiritual Evocation matters?

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:45.700
Unfortunately for you, the Spiritual Evocation
Department requested this of us.

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:50.240
We'll share what we find with both Policies
and the main Codrington Family.

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:52.000
How does that sound?

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:56.500
Oh, all right.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:12:59.250
Ms. Hishiri?

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:03.550
Since he can't escape anyway,
it's useless to restrict him.

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:07.220
Thank you so much.

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:11.600
Oh? You haven't been cleared
of your suspicion yet.

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:16.190
Whether or not you're the perpetrator
will come into light with the investigation,

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:18.110
correct?

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:21.860
Yes. That's correct.

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:25.650
I won't make conclusions
on matters that aren't proven.

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:28.280
That is the fundamental rule
in academics.

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:33.500
This is my father's study.

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:35.660
Please feel free to look around.

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:36.920
Thank you.

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:44.170
How are you related
to that young lady Waletta?

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:46.590
She's a childhood friend
from the main family.

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:49.680
A lot of things happened,
and she hates me.

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:54.480
Did you refuse to marry her?

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:57.350
Correct! What a brilliant detective!

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:01.570
If you're sentenced by Policies,

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:05.400
she'll likely take over this Workshop.

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:06.400
Yes.

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:10.240
Such a transparent picture to paint
sounds like something she'd do.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:13.990
And what about you?
How are you related to Ms. Adashino?

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:15.960
There was something in the past.

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:19.290
We have the worst compatibility
in all of the Clock Tower.

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:22.920
Now, can you finally talk to me...

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:26.670
about the other reason
why you called me here?

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:29.680
Yes. It seems she is here right now.

00:14:30.590 --> 00:14:31.800
Here?

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:35.680
Excuse me.

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:44.820
Is that...

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:46.650
a Fairy?

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:48.820
Yes.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.660
She seems to be a Fairy rooted to this land.

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:00.920
She disappeared?

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:06.380
She started to appear around
when the Workshop was complete.

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:16.310
That day was also stormy like today.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:22.900
You can see Fairies.

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:24.320
Fairy Eyes, huh?

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:28.610
It's not that strong for Mystic Eyes,
but I was born with them.

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:33.240
And every time she gives me
a warning, someone dies.

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:34.830
Then...

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:36.700
I want to know...

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:40.790
what she is warning me against.

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:42.630
The Wild Hunt...

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:44.590
An order of Fairy knights?

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:53.760
Ms. Reines, it's not good to investigate
the mansion without permission.

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:55.180
We should head back.

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:58.180
Oh?

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:00.430
What's this magical energy?

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:11.240
A hidden corridor!

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.200
We're getting into the swing of things!

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:16.080
You shouldn't! We need to inform Sir!

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:19.500
And if we do that,
Adashino will catch on, as well.

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:21.960
We need to investigate this first.

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:26.670
Besides, it's my principle to voluntarily
do things others don't want to do.

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:36.800
This feels familiar.

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:40.560
I can tell because I'm a grave-keeper.

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:43.560
This is a graveyard.

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:47.060
After all, these are ruins
a Necromancer purchased.

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:50.860
This must be the main keep
for the Magical Workshop.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:02.000
That's strange.

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:04.540
It's too soon for the eye drops
to lose effect!

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:11.090
I see. These ruins are creating
a response from my Mystic Eyes!

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:12.510
Let's head back!

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:13.630
Yeah.

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:17.930
That's not it.

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:22.100
These ruins are drawing out
the power of my Mystic Eyes.

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:24.140
If that's so—

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:32.360
Look out!

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:36.360
Gray!

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:47.500
Hey there, missies.

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:48.880
You guys okay?

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:51.130
Y-Yes!

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:54.130
And you are...

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:08.770
These are spirits
who were guarding the graveyard.

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:12.650
It seems they perceive
you missies as grave robbers.

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:14.530
They're not wrong per se.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:20.370
Well, damn.

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:22.950
They're getting even more excited now.

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:25.660
I know a secret passageway back out.

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:27.830
It will be slightly rough for an escort.

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:30.210
Think you missies can keep up?

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:31.790
Yes.

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:37.720
Reines!

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:38.800
She's fine.

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:40.590
She's just passed out.

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:42.600
And you are...

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:44.970
He was the one who saved her.

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:47.230
Kairi Shishigou.

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:49.480
A Necromancer and a mercenary.

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:53.730
Originally from Japan,
he accepts even the dirtiest of jobs.

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:56.490
He's quite famous over at Policies.

00:18:56.990 --> 00:19:01.490
I recall I still had a seat
in the Clock Tower for now.

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:04.830
And what is a celebrity like him here for?

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:07.870
Mr. Shishigou is one of my father's friends.

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:10.580
I came here to express
my condolences.

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:13.790
And? You didn't even show up
at the mansion.

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:16.210
What was a visitor doing
in the graveyard?

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:19.220
That graveyard is connected
to the bottom of the hill.

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:24.100
It was more convenient to pass through there
to avoid lightning in getting here.

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:30.020
So I see.

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:31.810
And there's this storm.

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:35.770
Little boy Wills, is the room
I usually use still left as is?

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:37.860
Yes. I'll show you the way.

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:52.540
Seriously, why are we in the same room?

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:55.460
I believe it's optimal for bearing children.

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:57.630
Ch... Wh-Why such a thought?

00:19:57.880 --> 00:20:01.680
Unfortunately, your Magical Circuits
are complete garbage of course.

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:02.930
Wha...

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:06.430
But it's not a bad seed for a successor.

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:10.180
It's not a bad idea to use
this opportunity to set it up, right?

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:12.690
Give me a break!

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:14.310
Shut up and go to sleep!

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:18.690
Jeez! You still can't take a joke, can you?

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:23.320
If you have that much energy,
I guess you're all right.

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:29.200
The underground graveyard
was a hive of spirits, but this bed is nice.

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:33.370
The Leyline of this land
reacts with Mystic Eyes.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:36.750
Thunder, Mystic Eyes, graveyard...

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:39.460
I need just a little more
for everything to connect.

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:43.340
That's it!

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:44.970
What's the matter?

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:47.220
There's something I need to confirm.

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:51.100
Listen to what Gray says
and be a good girl by staying in bed.

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:52.100
Got that?

00:20:57.060 --> 00:20:59.190
What is the meaning of this, Hishiri?

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:00.990
Of what?

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:02.570
Don't play dumb with me.

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:05.200
Why is Modern Magecraft Theories intervening?

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:07.410
It's nothing to worry about.

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:11.200
I can't afford to hand this Workshop
over to the likes of Bram!

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:16.630
For us Mages, the howdunit
and the whodunit are both meaningless.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:21.510
Because all of that can be decided for
by all of us in Policies.

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:29.140
Is the warped image
the correct one or is it mistaken?

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:31.890
That is what we determine.

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:33.980
So,

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:35.850
please rest assured.

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:42.110
Just as I thought.

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:44.030
And if that's the case...

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:47.030
EPISODE 4: A Workshop, a Grave, and a Necromancer

00:23:21.540 --> 00:23:23.500
Sir! Sir!

00:23:26.550 --> 00:23:28.470
What's wrong, Gray?

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:29.760
It's terrible!

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:31.640
Ms. Waletta was struck by lightning!

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:34.720
We have yet another casualty?
